---

<ProjectShell
  title="Ayu DocConnect"
  previous={{ title: 'Integrated Channels Suite', href: '/projects/integrated-channels' }}
  next={{ title: 'Ayu Sales Intelligence & Field Force Optimization', href: '/projects/ayu-sales-intelligence' }}
  navSections={navSections}
  ctaText="View Projects"
  ctaHref="/#portfolio"
  showProjectFooter={false}
  viewportFitPrototype={true}
  profileImage="/profile/portrait.png"
>
  <main class="docconnect-case">
    <!-- 01 · Overview -->
    <section id="overview" class="case-page dc-overview" style={`--reference-ratio:${pages[0].ratio}`}>
      <div class="case-page-inner">
        <AyuHealthBrand className="dc-overview-brand" />
        <div class="dc-overview-main">
          <div class="dc-overview-copy">
            <h1><em>Ayu DocConnect</em><span>Turn doctor relationships</span><span>into a connected</span><span>digital care journey.</span></h1>
            <p class="case-lede">Ayu DocConnect is a doctor engagement, referral and patient journey platform that brings referral doctors, patient journeys and healthcare services into one connected digital experience, enabling stronger collaboration and better patient care.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="dc-hero-art">
            <img class="dc-doctor-portrait" src="/ayu-docconnect/doctor-portrait.png" alt="Doctor using the Ayu DocConnect workspace" />
            <svg class="dc-overview-connectors" viewBox="0 0 900 600" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="dc-overview-arrow" viewBox="0 0 6 6" refX="5" refY="3" markerWidth="4" markerHeight="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 6 3 0 6Z" fill="#087cf0" stroke="none"/></marker></defs><path d="M647 190 C675 190 663 120 689 120 M647 272 C675 272 665 324 689 324 M642 388 C667 388 659 528 689 528" marker-end="url(#dc-overview-arrow)"/></svg>
            <div class="dc-device-card"><small><svg class="dc-workspace-mark" viewBox="0 0 48 56" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="0" y="20" width="44" height="16" rx="4" fill="#13b8d0"/><rect x="17" y="20" width="16" height="36" rx="4" fill="#4abddd"/><rect x="17" y="0" width="17" height="39" rx="4" fill="#ffac27"/><rect x="17" y="21" width="31" height="17" rx="4" fill="#ffac27"/></svg><b>Ayu DocConnect</b></small><div class="dc-device-actions"><span><DocConnectIcon name="person-add" /><b>Refer<br/>Patient</b></span><span><DocConnectIcon name="document" /><b>Track<br/>Journey</b></span><span><DocConnectIcon name="people" /><b>Engage</b></span></div><div class="dc-care-flow">{[['amber','person','Referral'],['blue','hospital','OPD'],['green','hospital','IPD'],['violet','doctor','Discharge']].map(([tone,icon,label],index)=><span class={`tone-${tone}`}><i><DocConnectIcon name={icon}/></i><b>{label}</b>{index < 3 && <svg viewBox="0 0 20 8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 4h18m-4-3 4 3-4 3"/></svg>}</span>)}</div></div>
            <div class="dc-hero-tag dc-tag-hospital"><DocConnectIcon name="hospital"/><span><b>Ayu Hospitals</b><small>Better collaboration<br/>across the network</small></span></div>
            <div class="dc-hero-tag dc-tag-patient"><DocConnectIcon name="people"/><span><b>Patients</b><small>Improved care continuity</small></span></div>
            <div class="dc-hero-tag dc-tag-doctor"><DocConnectIcon name="doctor"/><span><b>Referral Doctors</b><small>Stronger<br/>relationships</small></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dc-value-row">
          <article class="dc-value-card tone-blue"><span class="dc-symbol"><DocConnectIcon name="person-add" /></span><div><h2>Refer Digitally</h2><p>Enable referral doctors to refer patients easily and keep them within the Ayu Health network.</p></div></article>
          <article class="dc-value-card tone-green"><span class="dc-symbol"><DocConnectIcon name="document" /></span><div><h2>Track Patient Journeys</h2><p>Provide real-time visibility across the patient journey from referral to discharge.</p></div></article>
          <article class="dc-value-card tone-amber"><span class="dc-symbol"><DocConnectIcon name="people" /></span><div><h2>Stay Engaged with Ayu</h2><p>Deliver relevant information, updates and opportunities to strengthen long-term relationships with doctors.</p></div></article>
          <div class="dc-overview-caption">A connected ecosystem for doctors, patients and healthcare services.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02 · Product ecosystem -->
    <section id="ecosystem" class="case-page dc-ecosystem" style={`--reference-ratio:${pages[1].ratio}`}>
      <div class="case-page-inner">
        <article class="dc-dark-story dc-eco-story">
          <div class="case-kicker"><i></i> Product Ecosystem</div>
          <h2>A connected ecosystem enabling <em>doctor engagement, patient care journeys</em> and <em>network growth.</em></h2>
          <p>Ayu DocConnect brings together referral doctors, patients, hospitals, sales teams and external services into a single digital ecosystem — connecting referrals, care journeys, engagement, incentives and growth across the Ayu Health network.</p>
          <ul class="dc-check-list"><li>End-to-end doctor and patient journey connectivity</li><li>Digital referrals and real-time journey visibility</li><li>Engagement, incentives and network-driven growth</li><li>Integration with healthcare services and external platforms</li></ul>
          <div class="dc-eco-loop"><small>DOCTOR ECOSYSTEM</small><div><span><b><DocConnectIcon name="chat"/></b>Engage<br/>Doctors</span><i></i><span><b><DocConnectIcon name="hospital"/></b>Enable<br/>Patient Care</span><i></i><span><b><DocConnectIcon name="network"/></b>Grow<br/>Network</span></div></div>
        </article>
        <div class="dc-ecosystem-content">
          <div class="dc-network-map">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 600" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">{[['#087cf0',354,120,421,185],['#00b794',646,120,579,185],['#ff9d0a',336,300,386,300],['#ed3a82',664,300,614,300],['#8428f4',354,480,421,415],['#087cf0',646,480,579,415]].map(([color,x1,y1,x2,y2])=><g><path d={`M${x1} ${y1} ${x2} ${y2}`} style={`stroke:${color}`}/><circle cx={x1} cy={y1} r="4" style={`fill:${color}`}/><circle cx={x2} cy={y2} r="6" style={`fill:${color}`}/></g>)}</svg>
            {ecosystemNodes.map(node => <article class:list={['dc-network-node', `tone-${node.tone}`, node.position]}><span class="dc-node-icon"><DocConnectIcon name={node.icon} /></span><div><h3>{node.title}</h3><ul>{node.bullets.map(bullet => <li>{bullet}</li>)}</ul></div></article>)}
            <div class="dc-network-hub"><span><DocConnectIcon name="ayu" /></span><strong>Ayu<br/>DocConnect</strong><small>Doctor Engagement &amp;<br/>Referral Platform</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="dc-outcome-strip"><small>KEY ECOSYSTEM OUTCOMES</small><div>{ecosystemOutcomes.map(([tone, title, text],index) => <article class={`tone-${tone}`}><i class="dc-outcome-icon"><DocConnectIcon name={['people','heart','network','gear'][index]}/></i><div><b>{title}</b><span>{text}</span></div></article>)}</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 03 · The challenge -->
    <section id="challenge" class="case-page dc-challenge" style={`--reference-ratio:${pages[2].ratio}`}>
      <div class="case-page-inner">
        <article class="dc-dark-story dc-challenge-story">
          <div class="case-kicker"><i></i> The Challenge</div>
          <h2>Doctor relationships existed, but the <em>journey was fragmented.</em></h2>
          <p>Ayu Health had strong relationships with referral doctors, but the engagement, referral and patient journey were largely offline and fragmented across people, systems and touchpoints. Referring doctors lacked a single digital platform to refer patients, track progress and stay engaged with Ayu.</p>
          <ul class="dc-check-list"><li>Limited digital engagement and visibility for doctors</li><li>Fragmented patient journey across multiple touchpoints</li><li>Heavy dependence on BDM-led, offline interactions</li><li>Network growth reliant on direct relationships</li></ul>
          <div class="dc-fragmented-flow"><small>FROM FRAGMENTED INTERACTIONS ...</small><div>{[['pink','people','Offline','Interactions'],['blue','database','Multiple','Touchpoints'],['amber','eye','Limited','Visibility'],['violet','bars','Slower','Network Growth']].map(([tone,icon,first,second],index)=><><span class={`tone-${tone}`}><b><DocConnectIcon name={icon}/></b>{first}<br/>{second}</span>{index < 3 && <i/>}</>)}</div></div>
        </article>
        <div class="dc-challenge-main">
          <div class="dc-challenge-cards">{challenges.map(item => <article class={`dc-challenge-card tone-${item.tone}`}><span class="dc-challenge-icon"><DocConnectIcon name={item.icon} /></span><span class="dc-challenge-number">{item.number}</span><small class="dc-challenge-label">THE FRICTION</small><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><ul>{item.bullets.map(bullet => <li>{bullet}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div>
          <div class="dc-challenge-photo"><img class="dc-challenge-doctor" src="/ayu-docconnect/doctor-portrait-challenge-phone.png" alt="Doctor viewing a patient's referral journey"/><b class="dc-photo-callout dc-photo-referred"><DocConnectIcon name="person-add"/>Patient Referred</b><b class="dc-photo-callout dc-photo-track"><DocConnectIcon name="eye"/>Track Journey</b><b class="dc-photo-callout dc-photo-updates"><DocConnectIcon name="hospital"/>OPD · IPD<br/>Updates</b><b class="dc-photo-callout dc-photo-incentives"><DocConnectIcon name="gift"/>Earn Incentives</b></div>
          <div class="dc-impact-row"><small>IMPACT OF FRAGMENTATION</small><div>{fragmentation.map(([title, text],index) => <article class={`tone-${['pink','violet','blue','green'][index]}`}><i><DocConnectIcon name={['clock','people','network','bars'][index]}/></i><div><b>{title}</b><span>{text}</span></div></article>)}</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 04 · Product strategy -->
    <section id="strategy" class="case-page dc-strategy" style={`--reference-ratio:${pages[3].ratio}`}>
      <div class="case-page-inner">
        <article class="dc-dark-story dc-strategy-story">
          <div class="case-kicker"><i></i> Product Strategy</div>
          <h2>Turn referral activity into an <em>engagement and growth loop.</em></h2>
          <p>A focused product strategy to digitise referrals, create continuous visibility, build engagement and scale through the doctor network.</p>
          <ul class="dc-check-list"><li>Digitise the end-to-end referral journey</li><li>Create continuous visibility into patient progression</li><li>Build engagement loops with incentives and services</li><li>Enable doctor-to-doctor referrals for network growth</li></ul>
          <div class="dc-strategy-outcomes"><small>STRATEGY OUTCOMES</small><div>{[['blue','doctor','More','Doctor Referrals'],['green','eye','Higher','Engagement'],['violet','gift','Stronger','Doctor Network'],['amber','bars','Measurable','Business Impact']].map(([tone,icon,first,second])=><span class={`tone-${tone}`}><b><DocConnectIcon name={icon}/></b>{first}<br/>{second}</span>)}</div></div>
        </article>
        <div class="dc-strategy-main">
